# Upstream files this integration deliberately does not ship.
#
# Intentionally empty.
#
# This used to list the standalone marketing shell — Home.jsx, About.jsx,
# Services.jsx, Footer.jsx, Navbar.jsx, Navbar.css and components/SEO.jsx. Those
# seven render this application's own public face, which TibaDesk already
# provides, so shipping them unrouted left dead weight and a trap: one import
# away from a second navbar on the panel.
#
# They are now shipped and referenced by nothing. Nothing in resources/js/ imports
# them, so they cannot reach a route. (The six Footer imports in this app are all
# components/pdf/Footer, a different file, and are unaffected.)
#
# The rule is upstream files are never deleted: a module that drops its author's
# files cannot be diffed back against the source it came from. What keeps a second
# website off the screen is routing, not deletion — TibaDesk's site is served by
# the host app, and this application's panel is reached through /apps/dental/,
# where these components have no route.
#
# If you ever need a path deleted here, list it one per line below. Paths are
# relative to the application root and are checked by bin/sync-apps.sh --verify.
# Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
